<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
How does this config work:
- Gold and XP from stages, and XP needed for each team level.
- The game makes the full tables from these few numbers when it starts.
- If a value is missing, the game uses its own default number.

How to change the values in the config:
- To give more gold, raise coinsStarting (first stage) or coinsIncrease (how fast it grows).
- To make leveling slower, raise the xp values in TeamExperience.
- Tutorial = gold and tcrystals given for finishing the tutorial map. Default is currently 1000 gold and 50 tcrystals.
- StageRewards rows = how many stages get a reward. Make it bigger if you add more locations.
- TeamExperience makes one value for every team level, up to maxLevel in Team.xml.
- GoldenGoblin spawnChance = the chance (0 to 100) that a stage has a golden goblin. Its loot is set on the GoldenGoblin line in Enemies.xml.
-->
<Rewards>
	<!-- Winning with 3 stars multiplies gold and XP by threeStarMultiplier. firstThreeStarCrystals: tcrystals for the first 3-star clear of a stage. -->
	<Stars threeStarMultiplier="2" firstThreeStarCrystals="5" />

	<!-- Chance (0 to 100) that a stage has a golden goblin. The original game decided this on its server, so the real chance is unknown. -->
	<GoldenGoblin spawnChance="5" />

	<!-- Reward payout for finishing the tutorial map: gold, and tcrystals as the 3-star bonus. -->
	<Tutorial money="1000" crystal="50" />

	<!-- Rewards for each stage. You only set the first stage and how fast it grows, and the game works out the rest. 
	- coinsStarting / xpStarting = gold and XP from the first stage. 
	- coinsStartIncreasing / xpStartIncreasing = how much more the second stage gives. 
	- coinsIncrease / xpIncrease = how much bigger that jump gets for each stage after that. 
	- combatStarting / combatStartIncreasing / combatIncrease = the same, but for the recommended team power shown on the stage. 
	- rows = how many stages get a reward (200 is enough for all 4 locations on every difficulty: Normal 20 stages each, Hard and Hell 15 each). -->
	<StageRewards rows="200" coinsStarting="1500" coinsStartIncreasing="10" coinsIncrease="5" xpStarting="510" xpStartIncreasing="280" xpIncrease="20" combatStarting="350" combatStartIncreasing="40" combatIncrease="20" />

	<!-- XP needed to level up the team. Level 1 needs xpStarting. Each level after that needs more XP than the one before, and the jump gets a little bigger every level (xpIncreaseGrowth). It goes up to maxLevel in Team.xml by itself. -->
	<TeamExperience xpStarting="510" xpStartIncreasing="240" xpIncrease="240" xpIncreaseGrowth="30" />
</Rewards>
